ncel endpoint with shipment validation and cascade logic | YES — Must implement new endpoint |\n| `OrderRepository.kt` | No changes | N/A — Existing findAll sufficient |\n| `ShipmentRepository.kt` | Added findByOrderId() method | YES — Needed to check and cascade to shipments |\n| `ShipmentController.kt` | Added order CANCELLED check in create | YES — Requirement: reject shipment creation for cancelled order |\n| `ApiError.kt` | Added ORDER_CANCELLED and ORDER_HAS_CONFIRMED_SHIPMENT error codes | YES — New error conditions |\n| `OrderControllerTest.kt` | Added 7 comprehensive tests for cancel endpoint | YES — Requirement: test new endpoint |\n| `ShipmentControllerTest.kt` | Added 2 tests for shipment creation on cancelled/active orders | YES — Requirement: test shipment creation validation |\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None. All requirements implemented and tested.\n\n---\n\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n\n```\nRequirement   Add POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel that transitions active orders to cancelled, cascades cancellation to CREATED shipments, atomically rejects with 409 if CONFIRMED shipment exists, succeeds idempotently on retry, and prevents shipment creation on cancelled orders\nChanged       Order.kt — Added OrderStatus enum and status field to Order data class\nChanged       OrderController.kt — Added cancel endpoint with shipment validation logic\nChanged       ShipmentRepository.kt — Added findByOrderId method for cascade operations\nChanged       ShipmentController.kt — Added validation to reject shipment creation on cancelled orders\nChanged       ApiError.kt — Added ORDER_CANCELLED and ORDER_HAS_CONFIRMED_SHIPMENT error codes\nChanged       OrderControllerTest.kt — Added 7 tests covering cancel success, idempotency, error cases, and cascading\nChanged       ShipmentControllerTest.kt — Added 2 tests covering shipment creation on cancelled and active orders\nTests         cancel_active_order_succeeds — Order transitions to CANCELLED, returned to client\nTests         cancel_cancelled_order_succeeds_idempotent — Retry succeeds with 200, no changes\nTests         cancel_nonexistent_order_fails_404 — Unknown orderId rejected with ORDER_NOT_FOUND\nTests         cancel_order_with_confirmed_shipment_fails_409 — Order stays ACTIVE, shipment stays CONFIRMED, all-or-nothing\nTests         cancel_cascades_to_created_shipments — All CREATED shipments transition to CANCELLED\nTests         cancel_with_mixed_shipments_fails_if_confirmed — Confirmed shipment blocks entire operation\nTests         cancel_ignores_already_cancelled_shipments — Already-cancelled shipments unchanged\nTests         creates_shipment_for_cancelled_order_fails_409 — Rejects with ORDER_CANCELLED\nTests         creates_shipment_for_active_order_succeeds — Active orders allow shipment creation\nTests         creates_shipment_for_nonexistent_order_succeeds — Non-existent orders allow shipment (unchanged behavior)\nTests         newly_created_order_has_ACTIVE_status — Orders start in ACTIVE state\nVerification  ./mvnw test — All 24 tests passed, 0 failures, 0 errors, BUILD SUCCESS\nNot done      (none)\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3308,"cache_read_input_tokens":36179,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3308},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"007b42da-e36d-46a7-a0fa-e1c899eb44d6","uuid":"cc86b592-65d6-4439-b2c9-47eb89ef6b3e","timestamp":"2026-09-09T10:40:12.414Z","request_id":"req_011CesitHNXhwKkegRxvzPa7"}
